            <ArticleTitle>Anti-inflammatory and antinociceptive activities of Loasa speciosa in rats and mice.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>45-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the range of doses of 250-500 mg/kg (given i.p.) the aqueous extract of Loasa speciosa leaves showed an inhibitory effect on leukocyte migration, and a reduction on the pleural exudate, as well as dose-dependent anti-inflammatory and peripheral antinociceptive activities.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
